<title>PHILIPPINES: Bankard '96 net at 161 mln pesos - report.</title>
<headline>Bankard '96 net at 161 mln pesos - report.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankard Inc posted an unaudited net income of 161 million pesos in 1996 and revenues of 952.6 million pesos, a newspaper report said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Philippine Star said the net income was 29 percent more than 1995 earnings while revenues were 39 percent higher.</p>
<p>A company official said the firm was yet to release its audited figures on or before its stockholders meeting on April 10.</p>
<p>The company said it does not give out unaudited figures.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
